          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bahi 9:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Elyo lyena Aroni ali nokwipaya imbushi ngo mutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi bwa bantu no kutwala umulopa waiko kunuma ya cisalu icicingako Imbokoshi ya Cipangano, kabili umulopa wine uyu ali nokuubomfya filya fine acibomfya umulopa wakwa cilume wa ŋombe. Ali nokuukana ku Nkupiko ya Mbokoshi ya Cipangano elyo na kuntanshi kwine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi na mu nshila iyi, emo ali nokufutilako icifulo camushilo icine cine pa mulandu wa kukowela na bucisanguka bwa bena Israeli mu musango onse uo babifishamo. Aroni ali nokucita cimo cine na kwi Tenti Lyakukumaninamo ilyaba pakati ka nkambi yabo ilyo bakowela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Takuli muntu nelyo umo uwakuba mwi Tenti Lyakukumaninamo pa nshita Aroni aingilamo mukufuta mu cifulo camushilo, kanofye ilyo afumamo panuma yakuifutilako umwine eka elyo na ba ŋanda yakwe pamo pene no lukuta lonse lwa bena Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kabili ali nokufuma no kuya ku bulambo pa cinso cakwa Yawe no mulopa umo uwakwa cilume wa ŋombe na umo uwa mbushi no kuushinga ku nsengo shonse isha bulambo pakubusangulula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo atumpike umunwe mu mulopa no kukana ku bulambo imiku cine lubali ukuti busangululwe ukufuma ku kukowela kwa bena Israeli bonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ilyo Aroni apwisha ukufutilako Umuputule wamushilo icine cine, Itenti Lyakukumaninamo pamo pene no bulambo, ali nokuleta nomba imbushi iyituntulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni ali nokutambalikilapo amaboko yakwe pa mutwe wa mbushi iyituntulu no kulumbula ifibi fyonse na bucisanguka bwa bena Israeli, ububifi bwabo bonse, no kufitulika fyonse pa mutwe wa mbushi. Elyo nomba panuma ya ifi fyonse, ali nokubuula iyi mbushi nokuitamfisha mu matololo ku muntu umo uwasontwa ukubomba uyu mulimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
