              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 23:26-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.29.7+NUM.29.8+NUM.29.9+NUM.29.10+NUM.29.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 29:7-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Yawe akonkomesha ukuti, “Ili e funde mufwile mulekonka lyonsefye. Pa bushiku bwalenga ikumi limo mu mweshi walenga cine lubali, mufwile ukuikanya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ukuikanya:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila ukuleka ukulya no kuitalusha kuli fyonse ifyakwisekesha.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " no kukanabombamo imilimo yonse, imwe mwe bene, umwikalacalo nangu umweni uo mwikala nankwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pantu pa bushiku bwine ubu, ebo muli nokufutilwako kuli Yawe pa bubifi bwenu pakuti musangululwe. Muli iyi nshila muli nokuba abasangululwa ku cinso cakwa Yawe, ukufuma ku bubifi bwenu bonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubu bushiku bwe Sabata ubwakutuusha no kuikanya, bwakuishishamo mwe bene. Ici e cipope camuyayaya ico mufwile ukulakonka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimapepo uwasubwa kabili uwalashikwa kukuba shimapepo, uwapeelwa na maka ayakuba pa malo yakwa wishi, eulifye nokufutilako abantu bonse kuli Yawe. Ali nokufwala ifyakufwala fya bushimapepo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no kufutilako icifulo camushilo, Itenti Lyakukumaninamo, pamo pene no bulambo, na bashimapepo bonse, elyo na bantu bonse aba lukuta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
